data: {"answer": "I appreciate you asking, but I don't have the ability to rename chats or modify conversation settings. That's a feature controlled by the platform you're using to access me.\n\nTo rename this chat, you'll typically need to:\n\n- **Look for a title field** at the top of the chat window and click on it to edit\n- **Check the chat's options menu** (often a \"\u22ef\" or gear icon) for a rename option\n- **Use the sidebar/menu** where your chat history is listed \u2014 many apps let you rename from there\n\nWhere are you accessing this chat from? I can give you more specific instructions if you let me know the platform (e.g., a web browser, mobile app, ChatGPT, Claude, etc.).", "rounds": 1, "escalations": 0, "executions": 0, "failed": 0, "total_tool_ms": 0}

